WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.055 --> 00:00:08.939
Nero and Dev were eating breakfast.

2
00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:15.609
"This new cereal is delicious!" Dev said.

3
00:00:15.610 --> 00:00:20.335
"Dad helped make it at the cereal factory."

4
00:00:20.336 --> 00:00:26.008
Nero looked up from his bowl. "Can I try some?"

5
00:00:26.009 --> 00:00:31.503
Dev shook his head. "Crackle Pops are people food."

6
00:00:31.504 --> 00:00:34.269
Dad came in.

7
00:00:34.270 --> 00:00:38.354
"Ready for Take Your Kid to Work Day, Dev?"

8
00:00:38.355 --> 00:00:44.545
Dev grinned. "Totally! I can't wait to tour the factory."

9
00:00:44.546 --> 00:00:47.375
Dad started making lunches.

10
00:00:47.376 --> 00:00:50.201
"I'll put yours in your backpack."

11
00:00:50.202 --> 00:00:54.499
"I want to go too," Nero whispered to Dev.

12
00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:57.614
"I want to see the cereal factory."

13
00:00:57.615 --> 00:01:01.957
"Dad, can Nero come?" Dev asked.

14
00:01:01.958 --> 00:01:07.896
"No," Dad said. "Dogs aren't allowed around the food."

15
00:01:07.897 --> 00:01:14.037
Nero started drooling. "Food!" he thought.

16
00:01:14.038 --> 00:01:18.104
"I could try some Crackle Pops!"

17
00:01:18.105 --> 00:01:26.242
"Sorry, Nero," Dev whispered. "We can have fun later."

18
00:01:26.243 --> 00:01:30.331
Dad and Dev left the kitchen to get ready.

19
00:01:30.332 --> 00:01:36.785
Nero's eyes narrowed. "I want to have fun right now."

20
00:01:36.786 --> 00:01:40.686
He crept over to Dev's backpack.

21
00:01:40.687 --> 00:01:45.374
Nero hopped inside and slid under Dev's lunch.

22
00:01:45.375 --> 00:01:48.703
"Mmm. That smells so good.

23
00:01:48.704 --> 00:01:51.578
I wish I could eat it!"

24
00:01:51.579 --> 00:01:55.540
Dev came back and picked up his backpack.

25
00:01:55.541 --> 00:02:01.582
"Oof! It's heavy!" He laughed.

26
00:02:01.583 --> 00:02:07.457
"I guess you packed a really big lunch, Dad.

27
00:02:07.458 --> 00:02:11.954
See you later, Nero!"

28
00:02:11.955 --> 00:02:16.213
Dad and Dev started walking to the factory.

29
00:02:16.214 --> 00:02:20.210
Nero bounced around inside the backpack.

30
00:02:20.211 --> 00:02:27.144
"I'm getting dizzy in here!" he thought.

31
00:02:27.145 --> 00:02:33.088
Finally he heard Dev say, "There's the factory!"

32
00:02:33.089 --> 00:02:38.368
"Yay!" Nero's tail started thumping hard.

33
00:02:38.369 --> 00:02:49.140
He tried to make it stop before Dev heard it.

34
00:02:49.141 --> 00:02:52.415
Then Nero heard some other sounds.

35
00:02:52.416 --> 00:02:56.065
Whoosh! Whoosh! Clank!

36
00:02:56.066 --> 00:02:59.753
"Hmm. That sounds familiar."

37
00:02:59.754 --> 00:03:04.036
Nero poked his nose out and sniffed.

38
00:03:04.037 --> 00:03:07.643
"Something smells familiar too."

39
00:03:07.644 --> 00:03:12.101
Nero tilted his head and sniffed again.

40
00:03:12.102 --> 00:03:15.749
"Familiar sounds . . . familiar smells . . .

41
00:03:15.750 --> 00:03:18.132
I've been here before!"

42
00:03:18.133 --> 00:03:31.218
Nero gulped. "I'm back at Dr. Shady's lab!"
